# Production API setting for `vite build` only (never used by `npm run dev`).
#
# "/" = call the API on this same site. On Vercel, admin/vercel.json forwards
# /api/* to the Render backend, so the login cookie (SameSite=Lax) belongs to
# the admin's own domain and is sent with every request. Calling the Render
# domain directly from the browser would be cross-site: the browser would drop
# the cookie and every request after login would fail with 401.
#
# VITE_ADMIN_API_BASE takes priority over VITE_API_URL (see src/api/axios.js),
# so a VITE_API_URL left in the Vercel dashboard can't undo this.
# Docker builds don't see this file and keep using their VITE_API_URL build arg.
VITE_ADMIN_API_BASE=/
VITE_API_URL=/
